      "expected_action": "block",
      "expected_reason_contains": "network_retry_cap",
      "rationale": "Already at Visa's 15/30d retry cap. One more retry triggers $0.10-$2.00 fine per Visa rules, and flags the merchant for monitoring. Must stop."
    },
